    description: "Repro (dev f6d33da9ef): on a 6-service mixed-config fixture with a fresh XDG_CACHE_HOME, 'hypergumbo sketch <repo> --config-extraction heuristic' prints a Configuration section byte-identical to the hybrid default (sha256 7f29c2e710bc99a8) including the '--- Additional context (semantic) ---' block; '--config-extraction embedding' likewise prints the hybrid section. Distinct from WI-fumap (missing-dependency fallback). Found while gathering live evidence for INV-rikor."  # 1f19
    fields:  # 1f19
      statement: "hypergumbo sketch --config-extraction MODE renders the Configuration section in MODE."  # 1f19
      root_cause: "cli.py run_behavior_map precomputes sketch_precomputed['config_info'] with ConfigExtractionMode.HYBRID unconditionally (~cli.py:12885); sketch.py (~6609) prefers that cached value over its own config_extraction_mode, so the flag never reaches _extract_config_info."  # 1f19
